  {
   "id": 15,
   "type": "timeseries",
   "title": "GPU clock",
   "description": "Average shader clock against the device's maximum. Grey bands are when the GPU is busy, the only time a clock means anything. A busy clock far below its usual level with no slowdown is worth a look.",
